    "title": "Whaling Museum launches 3rd Annual Sea Glass Fiction Contest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n16 hours ago The Whaling Museum of Cold Spring Harbor, in partnership with TBR News Media of Setauket, announces the launch of its 3rd Annual Sea Glass Fiction Contest, now including a new adult category. The contest invites students in grades 3 to 12 and adults across Nassau and Suffolk counties to craft original stories inspired by a single piece of sea glass selected by the Museum. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
